# X=2 exiles two creature cards and gives six counters. Becoming a copy of Grizzly Bears "except it's 0/0 and has this
# ability" keeps the counters (a 6/6 Bears) and the {2} ability - but that ability is linked only to the "As Mimeoplasm
# enters" exile printed on Mimeoplasm, which the copy no longer has (CR 607.1, 607.5): it refers to no exiled card, so
# Llanowar Elves, still in exile, is not a legal target of a second activation. Both cards stay in exile.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Entomb
